{"candidateAnswer":"Not entirely -- Jon started his studio mainly for financial stability, and Gina saw an opportunity in the market rather than following a personal passion","evidence":"[D1:4 | 4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023] Jon: Sorry to hear that! I'm starting a dance studio 'cause I'm passionate about dancing and it'd be great to share it with others.\n[D6:8 | 2:35 pm on 16 March, 2023] Gina: Thanks! I'm passionate about fashion trends and finding unique pieces. Plus, I wanted to blend my love for dance and fashion, so it was a perfect match.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7e47d0d9-8a04-5da8-bf04-0e4753581bd6","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:fad7d2b278d51e0703f5dbda6ff240e936aeb74964dcee63b36e1d765f9a3abf","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Do Jon and Gina start businesses out of what they love?","referenceAnswer":"Yes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"fad7d2b278d51e0703f5dbda6ff240e936aeb74964dcee63b36e1d765f9a3abf"}}]}